  "finding": "The screenplay contains three spoken dialogue occurrences of the expletive 'fucking': Mara in S003 ('selfish, glorious, fucking impossible man'), Teddy in S006 ('drunk with a fucking boat'), and Danny in S011 ('that was fucking beautiful'). Under the Motion Picture Association Classification and Rating Rules, more than one use of a harsher sexually-derived word as an expletive initially requires an R rating, absent a special two-thirds majority vote of the Rating Board allowing a PG-13 rating.",
  "remedy_detail": "If targeting a PG-13 rating without relying on a special two-thirds majority vote of the Rating Board, replace or cut at least two of the three occurrences of 'fucking' in S003, S006, or S011 with milder, non-sexually-derived language so that no more than one harsher sexually-derived expletive remains.",
  "remedy_action": "REPLACE",
  "severity": "HIGH"
}

